Chapter: Wrap64

Section: Wrapping Multiply

  w64-mul : Integer between -9223372036854775808 and 9223372036854775807 wrapping, Integer -> Integer between -9223372036854775808 and 9223372036854775807 wrapping
  w64-mul (a) (b) = a * b

Section: Wrapping Add and Subtract

  w64-add : Integer between -9223372036854775808 and 9223372036854775807 wrapping, Integer -> Integer between -9223372036854775808 and 9223372036854775807 wrapping
  w64-add (a) (b) = a + b

  w64-sub : Integer between -9223372036854775808 and 9223372036854775807 wrapping, Integer -> Integer between -9223372036854775808 and 9223372036854775807 wrapping
  w64-sub (a) (b) = a - b
